{"id": "fafc36af-3753-4cbe-a82d-d73a3f2dac22", "slug": "creative-assets-section", "title": "Creative Assets Section", "description": "Creative Assets Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Creative Assets Section\"\ndescription: \"Creative Assets Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#EC4899\"\n  secondary: \"#0F172A\"\n  accent: \"#6366F1\"\n  background: \"#0F172A\"\n  surface: \"#C8C8FF\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"16px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Creative Assets Section\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Vanh DesignCode (@vanh). Views: 30; favorites: 7; remixes: 3.\nTags: feature, section, animated, bento.\n## Overview\nCreative Assets Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nCreative Toolkit Inspiring modules for your next creation. Explore a collection of meticulously crafted components designed to elevate your digital experiences. Latest Projects Discover the most recent endeavors from ou…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Inspiring modules for your next creation.; Latest Projects; COMMUNITY PICKS; Meet the Team; Alex; Sarah.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #EC4899, secondary #0F172A, accent #6366F1, background #0F172A, surface #C8C8FF, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"antialiased\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Creative Assets Section</title>\n\n    <!-- Fonts -->\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <!-- Tailwind CSS -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: {\n                        sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'],\n                    },\n                    colors: {\n                        slate: {\n                            850: '#151e2e',\n                            900: '#0f172a',\n                        }\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n\n    <!-- Iconify -->\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <!-- GSAP & Three.js -->\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        body {\n            background-color: #f8fafc;\n            color: #0f172a;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n        }\n\n        /* WebGL Canvas */\n        #webgl-canvas {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            z-index: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom Gradients & Utilities */\n        .glass-panel {\n            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n        }\n\n        .dark-glass-panel {\n            background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.8);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(24px);\n        }\n\n        .gradient-border-premium {\n            position: relative;\n            background: linear-gradient(rgba(255,255,255,0.8), rgba(255,255,255,0.8)) padding-box,\n                        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(200,200,255,0.4), rgba(255,200,200,0.1)) border-box;\n            border: 1px solid transparent;\n        }\n\n        .gradient-border-dark {\n            position: relative;\n            background: linear-gradient(rgba(15,23,42,0.9), rgba(15,23,42,0.9)) padding-box,\n                        linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.5), rgba(236,72,153,0.1)) border-box;\n            border: 1px solid transparent;\n        }\n\n        /* Blob Animation for \"Latest Projects\" */\n        .blob-bg {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: -50%;\n            right: -20%;\n            width: 150%;\n            height: 150%;\n            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.15) 0%, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1) 40%, transparent 70%);\n            border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%;\n            animation: morph 15s ease-in-out infinite alternate;\n            z-index: -1;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        @keyframes morph {\n            0% { border-radius: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 50% 60% 50%; transform: rotate(0deg) scale(1); }\n            100% { border-radius: 70% 30% 50% 50% / 30% 30% 70% 70%; transform: rotate(45deg) scale(1.1); }\n        }\n\n        /* Perspective Container for 3D feel */\n        .perspective-container {\n            perspective: 2000px;\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n        }\n\n        .card-wrapper {\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n            will-change: transform;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen relative font-sans antialiased selection:bg-indigo-100 selection:text-indigo-900\">\n\n    <!-- WebGL Background -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Content Section -->\n    <main class=\"relative z-10 min-h-screen flex flex-col items-center justify-center py-24 px-6 lg:px-12 overflow-hidden\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <div class=\"text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-16 lg:mb-24 z-20\" id=\"header-content\">\n            <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/50 backdrop-blur-md border border-slate-200/50 mb-6 text-xs font-medium text-slate-600 uppercase tracking-widest shadow-sm\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:star-fall-linear\" width=\"14\" class=\"text-indigo-500\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span>Creative Toolkit</span>\n            </div>\n            <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-6 leading-[1.1]\">\n                Inspiring modules for your next creation.\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-base md:text-lg text-slate-500 font-light max-w-lg mx-auto\">\n                Explore a collection of meticulously crafted components designed to elevate your digital experiences.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Cards Grid / Composition -->\n        <div class=\"w-full max-w-6xl mx-auto perspective-container\" id=\"cards-container\">\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 lg:gap-10 items-center relative h-full w-full\">\n\n                <!-- Card 1: Latest Projects (Light, Soft) -->\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper md:col-span-5 md:col-start-1 z-20 group\" data-speed=\"0.05\">\n                    <div class=\"glass-panel gradient-border-premium rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-10 shadow-2xl shadow-slate-200/50 relative overflow-hidden h-full flex flex-col transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-indigo-100\">\n                        <div class=\"blob-bg\"></div>\n\n                        <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start mb-12\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900\">Latest Projects</h2>\n                            <div class=\"flex gap-2 text-slate-400\">\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chat-round-dots-linear\" width=\"20\" class=\"cursor-pointer hover:text-slate-800 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:menu-dots-circle-linear\" width=\"20\" class=\"cursor-pointer hover:text-slate-800 transition-colors\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-500 font-light leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-[80%]\">\n                            Discover the most recent endeavors from our vibrant community of creators and builders.\n                        </p>\n\n                        <div class=\"mt-auto flex items-center justify-between\">\n                            <button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full border border-slate-200 text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-50 transition-colors\">\n                                View Gallery\n                            </button>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex -space-x-3\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/2f563338-39fa-47ea-9761-658d4f3f84db_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover shadow-sm\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4f5668c5-fc4a-44e0-bc5e-a664189d3c31_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover shadow-sm\">\n                                <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/77415a2e-dcbc-4748-a29d-fced4821881a_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"User\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white object-cover shadow-sm\">\n                                <div class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full border-2 border-white bg-slate-100 flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-medium text-slate-500 shadow-sm z-10 relative\">\n                                    +5\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 2: Community Picks (Dark, Neon) -->\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper md:col-span-7 md:col-start-6 z-30 group\" data-speed=\"0.08\">\n                    <div class=\"dark-glass-panel gradient-border-dark rounded-3xl p-8 lg:p-12 shadow-2xl shadow-indigo-900/20 relative overflow-hidden h-[400px] flex flex-col justify-end transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-indigo-500/30\">\n\n                        <!-- Abstract Neon Image Background -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0\">\n                            <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/fa51902b-c2a4-4c33-a96e-a8f1ef67edc6_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Neon Abstract\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover object-right opacity-80 group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-1000 ease-out\">\n                            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-slate-900 via-slate-900/80 to-transparent\"></div>\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-sm\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-4\">\n                                <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-pink-500 shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(236,72,153,0.8)]\"></span>\n                                <span class=\"text-xs font-medium text-pink-400 tracking-wider uppercase\">Featured</span>\n                            </div>\n                            <h2 class=\"text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-white mb-6 leading-tight\">\n                                COMMUNITY<br>PICKS\n                            </h2>\n                            <button class=\"px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-white text-slate-900 text-xs font-medium hover:bg-slate-100 transition-colors inline-flex items-center gap-2\">\n                                Explore Selection\n                                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"16\"></iconify-icon>\n                            </button>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Card 3: Meet the Team (Pastel, Floating) -->\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper md:col-span-6 md:col-start-3 lg:-mt-12 z-10 group\" data-speed=\"0.03\">\n                    <div class=\"bg-white rounded-3xl p-8 shadow-xl shadow-slate-200/40 relative overflow-hidden h-full border border-slate-100 transition-all duration-500 hover:-translate-y-2 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-slate-200/60\">\n\n                        <!-- Pastel Abstract Bg from Aura -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20\">\n                           <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4734259a-bad7-422f-981e-ce01e79184f2_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Pastel Background\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover mix-blend-multiply blur-xl\">\n                        </div>\n\n                        <div class=\"relative z-10\">\n                            <h2 class=\"text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-8\">Meet the Team</h2>\n\n                            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-6 justify-center md:justify-start\">\n                                <!-- Team Member 1 -->\n                                <div class=\"text-center group/member cursor-pointer\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-16 h-20 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-3 relative gradient-border-premium shadow-sm transition-transform group-hover/member:-translate-y-1\">\n                                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/eca707cc-a5b7-439a-b4fd-247f6106c2e1_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Team\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-800\">Alex</h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\">Design</p>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Team Member 2 -->\n                                <div class=\"text-center group/member cursor-pointer mt-4\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-16 h-20 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-3 relative gradient-border-premium shadow-sm transition-transform group-hover/member:-translate-y-1\">\n                                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/77415a2e-dcbc-4748-a29d-fced4821881a_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Team\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-800\">Sarah</h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\">Engineering</p>\n                                </div>\n                                <!-- Team Member 3 -->\n                                <div class=\"text-center group/member cursor-pointer\">\n                                    <div class=\"w-16 h-20 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden mb-3 relative gradient-border-premium shadow-sm transition-transform group-hover/member:-translate-y-1\">\n                                        <img src=\"https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/assets/assets/4f5668c5-fc4a-44e0-bc5e-a664189d3c31_1600w.jpg\" alt=\"Team\" class=\"w-full h-full object-cover grayscale\">\n                                    </div>\n                                    <h3 class=\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-800\">Elena</h3>\n                                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\">Product</p>\n                                </div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Scripts for Logic and Animation -->\n    <script>\n        // --- WebGL Ambient Background (Three.js) ---\n        const initWebGL = () => {\n            const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n            const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n            scene.fog = new THREE.FogExp2(0xf8fafc, 0.001);\n\n            const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(75, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 1000);\n            camera.position.z = 30;\n\n            const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas: canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n            // Create particles\n            const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n            const particlesCount = 700;\n            const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i++) {\n                // Spread particles across a wide area\n                posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 100;\n            }\n\n            particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n\n            // Soft gray particles\n            const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n                size: 0.15,\n                color: 0x94a3b8,\n                transparent: true,\n                opacity: 0.4,\n                blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n            });\n\n            const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, material);\n            scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n            // Mouse interaction setup\n            let mouseX = 0;\n            let mouseY = 0;\n            let targetX = 0;\n            let targetY = 0;\n\n            const windowHalfX = window.innerWidth / 2;\n            const windowHalfY = window.innerHeight / 2;\n\n            document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n                mouseX = (event.clientX - windowHalfX);\n                mouseY = (event.clientY - windowHalfY);\n            });\n\n            // Animation Loop\n            const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n            const tick = () => {\n                const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n                // Gentle constant rotation\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.05;\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n\n                // Mouse follow with easing\n                targetX = mouseX * 0.001;\n                targetY = mouseY * 0.001;\n\n                particlesMesh.rotation.y += 0.05 * (targetX - particlesMesh.rotation.y);\n                particlesMesh.rotation.x += 0.05 * (targetY - particlesMesh.rotation.x);\n\n                renderer.render(scene, camera);\n                window.requestAnimationFrame(tick);\n            };\n\n            tick();\n\n            // Resize handler\n            window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n                camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n                camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n                renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n            });\n        };\n\n        // --- GSAP Animations ---\n        const initGSAP = () => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin();\n\n            // Initial Reveal Sequence\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n\n            // Animate Header\n            tl.from(\"#header-content > *\", {\n                y: 30,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // Animate Cards entering with 3D feel\n            tl.from(\".card-wrapper\", {\n                y: 100,\n                z: -100, // Start slightly pushed back\n                rotationX: 10,\n                rotationY: -10,\n                opacity: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.2,\n                ease: \"expo.out\"\n            }, \"-=0.6\");\n\n            // Ambient Parallax on Mouse Move\n            const container = document.getElementById('cards-container');\n            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.card-wrapper');\n\n            container.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const rect = container.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const x = e.clientX - rect.left - rect.width / 2;\n                const y = e.clientY - rect.top - rect.height / 2;\n\n                cards.forEach(card => {\n                    const speed = card.getAttribute('data-speed') || 0.05;\n                    // Calculate rotation based on mouse position relative to center\n                    const rotateY = (x * speed).toFixed(2);\n                    const rotateX = (-y * speed).toFixed(2); // Invert Y for natural tilt\n\n                    // Slight translation for deeper parallax\n                    const translateX = (x * speed * 0.5).toFixed(2);\n                    const translateY = (y * speed * 0.5).toFixed(2);\n\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        rotationX: rotateX,\n                        rotationY: rotateY,\n                        x: translateX,\n                        y: translateY,\n                        duration: 0.8,\n                        ease: \"power2.out\",\n                        transformPerspective: 1000\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n\n            // Reset transform on mouse leave\n            container.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                cards.forEach(card => {\n                    gsap.to(card, {\n                        rotationX: 0,\n                        rotationY: 0,\n                        x: 0,\n                        y: 0,\n                        duration: 1,\n                        ease: \"elastic.out(1, 0.5)\"\n                    });\n                });\n            });\n        };\n\n        // Initialize everything when DOM is ready\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            initWebGL();\n            initGSAP();\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "creative-assets-section.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/creative-assets-section.jpg", "source_name": "creative-assets-section-DESIGN.md", "views": 158, "forks": 6, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "1a62ed4c-6d0d-4900-8de2-1f3139579949", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T16:39:00.163144+00:00"}